      "message": "\u003e Though I\u0027m not aware of secretkeeper\u0027s current progress \n\nIt\u0027s fairly urgent that we can specify precisely how the secretkeeper public key is to be transferred to a pVM, and that will require the mechanism here - so we need to nail this down pretty soon.",
