      "writtenOn": "2024-01-16T02:04:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hello all,\nI\u0027ve heard there was a long chat thread \u0026 meeting in the last night. Sorry not to join, I wasn\u0027t aware of such conversation executed.\n\nBTW, I heard from Jaewan that there was a concrete conclusion regarding the design of VM base DTBO like below, and all agreed. The design seems fair to me as well, could I just proceed?\n\n- VM Base DTBO will be renamed to VM reference DT.\n- ABL will provide VM references DT to both host DT and pvmfw.\n  - To host DT: /avf/reference. This will map to the guest\u0027s DT root.\n  - To pvmfw: Written as DT in the VM reference DT entry.\n- ABL will provide vendor hashkey and SK pub keys under /avf/reference/avf/..., so the guest can access those values from /avf/...\n- VM reference DT can be used to add extra nodes/props other than AVF usages, so giving more freedom to vendors. But it shouldn\u0027t modify any props/nodes in platform DT.",
      "parentUuid": "fdd9cad4_4dcb06ba",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 210,
        "startChar": 31,
        "endLine": 210,
        "endChar": 45
      },
      "revId": "afd66dede221605d4412662548dfb95bc5f6fd77",
