      "message": "\u003e The design seems fair to me as well, could I just proceed?\n\nYes, please!\n\n\u003e What is \"platform DT\"?\n\nSomething that we shouldn\u0027t be mentioning in the docs :^)\n\nIt\u0027s a pre-compiled DT ([`platform.dts`](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Virtualization/pvmfw/platform.dts)) used by pvmfw as a base when rebuilding the guest DT from scratch.",
